/* COMPSTAT_NOUPDATEOK
 * linkage: win32-reference (6 statement(s), e.g. corpus/chm/windows-ce-3.0/wcesdkristreamsample__completionstatus.html)
 * header stated by the Win32 desktop reference only -- verify against the CE SDK
